 "schema": {
  "effects": "Observed fake-desktop changes per turn, lowercase: launch:<app>, type:<window title>:<text>, close:<title>, kill:<process>, power:<restart|shutdown|sleep|sign_out>, abort, url:<url>, media:<play_pause|next|previous>, lock, volume:<up|down>=<n>, mute:<on|off>, brightness:<up|down>=<n>, minimise|maximise|restore:<title>. Focus changes are not effects.",
  "expect": "A turn passes when any alternative passes. An alternative lists regexes (full match, case-insensitive) for required effects; 'allow' adds optional ones. Every observed effect must match a required or allowed pattern of some alternative, otherwise it is an unwanted action. Optional: outcome (engine outcome names), calls [{tool, args: {name: regex}}], reply_any / reply_none (regex search), lookup (a successful look_up ran), sent_none (regexes no Wikipedia query may contain), grounded (capitalized names in the reply appear in the question or the returned articles)."
 },
